 "description": "* above #20 floor\n* Bright and Windy \n* No extension \n* Bright and Windy \n\nView and discover your dream home! \n\nCall 8777 0076 for exclusive viewing!!!\n.\nDiscover your dream home! This stunning 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom HDB unit is available for sale now and spans a generous 1001 sqft, located at 93B, Telok Blangah Street 31, Singapore. Enjoy the convenience of being just a short distance from Telok Blangah MRT (0.6 km) and Labrador Park MRT (1.5 km). Families will appreciate the proximity to esteemed educational institutions such as ISS International School (1.4 km) and MOE Kindergarten @ Blangah Rise (0.9 km). Shopping is a breeze with FairPrice PSA Branch (0.9 km) and FairPrice Telok Blangah (0.5 km) nearby for all your daily needs. The Alexandra Retail Centre (ARC) (1.1 km) offers a variety of retail therapy options. The property boasts excellent project amenities, including a Playground, Mini-Mart, and Covered Linkways, ensuring a vibrant community atmosphere. Inside the unit, you will find Modern Kitchen furnishing, Wardrobe, and Water Heater, providing both comfort and convenience. Don’t miss out on this exceptional opportunity to own a beautiful home in a prime location. Act now and secure your future in this delightful HDB!",
